<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6038] [Storage V3] Error occurs when deleting an index</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6038</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Error occurs when attempting to delete an index on the model index page.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Steps: &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
1. Navigate to the model index page. &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
2. Select an index. &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
3. Click the delete button, and an error is reported.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13609021">KYLIN-6038</key>
            <summary>[Storage V3] Error occurs when deleting an index</summary>
